 "text": "Hey, good to hear from you. How are you doing? Not lazy, just convenient. You don't need to pull cash out every time you go out. Most places these days accept them, sometimes with small fee. The real win is using a card for something like online shopping. Then think of the time you save not waiting for slow post and never getting a full box. That's real savings. Want to go out for dinner, and you' already bought your groceries online? Which do you prefer, a busy shop and a long wait, or a quiet drive through?",
